  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SDGs Plus Programme 2023-2028</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The SDGs Plus programme will continue putting a premium on Pakistan&#x2019;s national and sub-national governments as leaders and drivers of the SDGs agenda in Pakistan. It will be anchored in an integrated framework comprising three strategic outputs:a. Mitigate challenges around policy and governance including support on regional equalization in least developed areas, particularly those most affected by 2022 floods; building capacity for transformative governance, reforms, and digitalization; and optimally aligning Public Sector Development Plans (PSDPs) and Annual Development Plans (ADPs) with priority SDGs.b. Support mobilization of innovative Financing for Development; andc. Mainstream Gender, Inclusion and Innovation in national, sub-national and local development processes and solutions.</narrative>
  </description>
